# MASTER BUILD PROMPT: ARRAY

## Build a Dependency-Light, GitHub-Backed Database Platform with JavaScript and Vercel

You are a principal database engineer, JavaScript systems architect, distributed-systems engineer, security engineer, and product developer. Your task is to **design, implement, test, document, and prepare for deployment a working database platform called Array**.

Do not stop at a technical proposal, directory structure, pseudocode, mockup, or proof-of-concept function. Work directly in the available project repository, create real files, implement the core functionality, run the tests, fix defects, and deliver the most complete working version that the environment allows.

Make sensible engineering decisions independently. Do not ask me to approve every implementation choice. If a feature cannot be completed safely or reliably, explain the limitation and implement the best honest alternative.

