# 15. Indexes and Query Performance

Implement indexes incrementally and correctly.

Initial priorities:

1. Primary-key lookup
2. Chunk manifest lookup
3. One or more secondary indexes
4. Partitioned index storage
5. Index rebuild and verification commands

