- Meaningful nonzero exit codes on failure
- No accidental credential output
- No silent destructive actions

The CLI should use the same database, format, and storage APIs as the HTTP service. Do not build a separate, incompatible data path just to make the CLI work.

Before selecting final npm package names, check availability and potential naming conflicts. Do not publish packages unless explicitly authorized.

