# 19. Observability and Diagnostics

Implement a small structured logging system without a mandatory third-party logging dependency.

Provide metrics or diagnostic summaries for:

- Storage requests
- Rate-limit responses
- Read and write failures
- Retries
- Query duration
- Chunks read and written
- Import progress
- Export progress
- Manifest generations
- Detected data corruption
