- Path traversal attempts
- Stale manifests
- Two competing writers
- API timeouts after writes
- Rate-limit responses
- Interrupted imports
- Duplicate batch submissions
- Failed finalization
- Partial export failures

## Performance tests

Benchmark representative workloads against a clearly defined dataset:

- Primary-key lookups
- Indexed equality filters
- Unindexed scans
- Inserts
- Updates
- Deletes
- Import throughput
- Export throughput
- Cold storage requests versus cached reads

Report dataset sizes, number of iterations, runtime environment, warm-up strategy, and whether network calls are included.

Do not invent performance results or claim superiority over PostgreSQL, MongoDB, or other mature systems without fair, reproducible benchmarks.

